# A copy of a defaulted field into a field with another default: an instance omitting it fills with both.
-- source.cue --
a: *1 | int
-- target.cue --
a: *2 | int
-- lens.cue --
v0_0: _
v1_0: {a: v0_0.a}
-- out --
not total
v1_0.a copies v0_0.a, which an instance may omit; it then fills with 1 in the source schema and with 2 in the target schema, and the copy has no single value (rule copy-narrowed) @ lens.cue:2:11
